03:50:36 <elliott> well
03:50:36 <elliott> All standard instructions are one character long and range from ASCII 32 (space) to ASCII 126 (~). There are no multicharacter instructions in Funge.
03:50:41 <elliott> ais523: it tells you a lot of things about instructions
03:50:44 <elliott> but not what an instruction actually is
03:50:47 <elliott> An instruction is executed by an IP every tick. The IP executed is the one at the current position of the IP. Only after that does the IP moves by its delta to a new position.
03:50:48 <elliott> etc.
03:51:11 <ais523> hmm, why is the funge-98 spec not linked from the wiki?
