03:51:55 <elliott> Where the k is is part of execution state, not instruction state. The specification creates plenty of tracking of additional state without explicitly stating that it is doing so.
03:52:03 <ais523> elliott: you can't claim that "instruction" includes "position in the source"
03:52:06 <elliott> It does so with off-hand notes, e.g. fields of y that require whole-interpreter tracking to satisfy.
