06:29:43 <fizzie> SCKE just adds a v4-only gethostbyname() instruction ('H') and a poll command ('P').
06:29:44 <ais523> the way it works is, if you DNS lookup an IPv6 address, it returns an IPv4 address in the multicast region
06:29:58 <ais523> and then translates between them NAT-style
06:30:07 <ais523> umm, until the application exits, I think
06:30:25 --- quit: poiuy_qwert (Client Quit)
06:30:30 <ais523> so IPv4 programs can use IPv6 without any modification at all
